KJV: Reumah.

H7209.definition:
from H7200 (רָאָה);
a mirror (as seen)
KJV: looking glass.

H7210.definition:
from H7200 (רָאָה);
sight, whether abstractly (vision) or concretely (a spectacle)
KJV: gazingstock, look to, (that) see(-th).

H7211.definition:
from H7200 (רָאָה) and H3050 (יָהּ); Jah has seen;
